The problem is that creatures are normally generated out of sight, so no
creature will be created *immediately* next to you. On ordinary levels,
this means that they will be generated in other rooms or corridors.

However, "in sight" above means that you are unable to see them with
normal sight. Telepathy is not included, since this would mean that no
creatures would be generated at all. Hence, when you're only seeing things
with telepathy, creatures can be generated *everywhere* on the level,
including in the spot next to you.

On Medusa, this can be lethal...

